<h1 style="font-size:22px;margin:0 0 12px;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hi <%= user.first_name %>, we received a request to reset the password for your account.</p>
<p style="margin:20px 0;"><a href="<%= link %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#D81E1E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;border:2px solid #111111;">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;color:#555555;">Or copy this link into your browser:<br><%= link %></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#555555;">The link is valid for 60 minutes and can be used once. If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email and your password will stay the same.</p>
